      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'F steps off. Mouse looks freely on foot; WASD walks. E takes, connects
    and returns the hose and operates supply. The wall station is right of the parked
    machine.


    Close supply, uncouple, return the nozzle and F to board. Driving
    beyond hose reach breaks the coupling and spills water.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
